OpenCV, version 4.14.0, commit 0654a42e19215ef25b1d367d822f3c630447e7c7
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository includes independent reimplementations of OpenCV behavior and
adapted portions of permissively licensed OpenCV source. The monitored CPU
refinement arithmetic in cpu/cpu_sparse_pyramid.cpp is adapted from the BSD
cornersubpix.cpp implementation. The CPU contour scanner is adapted from the
Apache-2.0 contours_truco.cpp implementation. Other reproduced arithmetic,
evaluation order and rounding support compatibility checks against the CPU
baseline. The files and nature of each reuse are recorded in module sidecars
and docs/code-provenance.md.

